:HELP NAME=CFGTCPSMTP.Configure TCP/IP SMTP (CFGTCPSMTP)
:P.The Configure TCP/IP SMTP (CFGTCPSMTP) command works with the SMTP
menu.
:P.The command has no parameters.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGFTPA.Change FTP Attributes (CHGFTPA)
:P.The Change FTP Attributes (CHGFTPA) command works with the FTP
server's attributes, kept in the TCP/IP server table in QUSRSYS and read
when the server and its sessions start.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/AUTOSTART'.Autostart servers (AUTOSTART)
:P.The autostart servers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/NBRSVR'.Number of initial servers (NBRSVR)
:P.The number of initial servers for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 20.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/INACTTIMO'.Inactivity timeout (INACTTIMO)
:P.The inactivity timeout for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 2147483.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/CCSID'.Coded character set identifier (CCSID)
:P.The coded character set identifier&colon. the code page and character
set the data is in, or is to be converted to.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 65533.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/TBLFTPOUT'.Outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table (TBLFTPOUT)
:P.The outgoing EBCDIC/ASCII table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/TBLFTPIN'.Incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table (TBLFTPIN)
:P.The incoming ASCII/EBCDIC table for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CCSID:EPK.
:PD.The CCSID determines the conversion.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/NAMEFMT'.Initial name format (NAMEFMT)
:P.The initial name format for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *LIB, *PATH.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/CURDIR'.Initial directory (CURDIR)
:P.The initial directory for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *HOMEDIR.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/LISTFMT'.Initial list format (LISTFMT)
:P.The initial list format for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *UNIX.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/CRTCCSID'.Create database files CCSID (CRTCCSID)
:P.The create database files CCSID for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*CALC:EPK.
:PD.The system calculates the value.
:PT.:PK.*USER:EPK.
:PD.The user.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 1 to 65533.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/SBSD'.Subsystem description (SBSD)
:P.The subsystem description, by name and library.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGFTPA/ALWSSL'.Allow secure sockets layer (ALWSSL)
:P.The allow secure sockets layer for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*ONLY:EPK.
:PD.The only one&colon. an error is sent when more than one matches.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
