:HELP NAME='CHGSMTPA/RTYMIN'.Retries by minute (RTYMIN)
:P.The retries by minute for this command.
:P.The value has 2 parts, given in order&colon.
:H4.Part 1&colon. Number of retries
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 99.
:EPARML.
:H4.Part 2&colon. Time interval
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*DFT:EPK.
:PD.The default value.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
